### Validation Status

**17p5-0add-18deg-75s-N2-1800s** (run1): Modulus 936 bar, PF 0.27 — only 1 retained fit (SD=0, CV=null), very uncertain. Run2 gave 733/0.30 with top-edge gap. Run6 gave 699/0.26 with clean membrane. Three runs exist but run1 is an outlier with a single-specimen fit; runs 2 and 6 are more consistent (~700–734 bar, 0.26–0.30 PF). This candidate is partially validated but the high-modulus run1 is not confirmed.

