This is the correct next experiment: validate this candidate with an independent synthesis repeat at identical parameters.

**Expected benefit**: If confirmed, this would establish a reproducible high-pore-fraction point (~0.44) on the Pareto front. Even if modulus is low (~330 bar), it would anchor the high-porosity end of the front. The clean membrane image in run4 suggests the synthesis is feasible. The single-fit result means we cannot yet trust the modulus or pore fraction values.

